Description: Tools and functions to estimate actual evapotranspiration with
    surface energy balance models. Implements the METRIC model (Allen et al.,
    2007, <doi:10.1061/(ASCE)0733-9437(2007)133:4(380)>) for Landsat 7, 8 and 9
    images, including Collection 2 Level-2 surface reflectance and surface
    temperature products, together with weather station data processing and
    reference evapotranspiration (ASCE Penman-Monteith).
